# The finder page's committed build is generated: `npm run build` in
# crates/finder/web writes it, and the build-freshness check (ci.yml's finder-page
# job and the `test` gate) proves it is the build of the source beside it. Its
# minified, content-hashed files are not reviewable as text, so diffs show them as
# changed rather than printing them. A rebuilt bundle alone is ~590 KB of patch,
# more than the factory's judged-diff ceiling.
crates/finder/web/dist/** -diff linguist-generated=true
